The audio decoders behind the SM1 engine, for ipod_classic_sm1_codec.c.

Upstream's files, unchanged, apart from minimp3/minimp3.c, which is a few lines
of ours that turn the header into an object file.  The meson library that builds
them is in hw/arm/meson.build.

