faad2/
    https://github.com/knik0/faad2
    release 2.11.4
    GNU GPL version 2 or later, see faad2/COPYING

    Code from FAAD2 is copyright (c) Nero AG, www.nero.com

    libfaad/ and include/neaacdec.h, flattened into one directory and cut to what
    a build for AAC LC compiles, as gcc -MM reports it for the flags in meson.build.
    Those leave out Main, LTP, SSR, the error resilient profiles, DRM and SBR.
    What the firmware does with an HE-AAC file on these has not been tried.
